<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Dũya Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">1 Ubitru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ubvur uwu inggbaashia Ubitru aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ubitru</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Ubi</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ubvur uwu inggbaashia</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ubitru</para>
  <para style="mt2">aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="imt">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur uwu inggbaashia Ubitru aka atsɛng</para>
  <para style="ip">Awu Ubitru uner itser Uyesu atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ. Abɔɔ akaifɛrhkɔ ugɛ atsɛng ubvur uwurɛ ra amɛk aki 60-68 udzur ru unumkpi umbɔ aka amar Uyesu. Atsɛnge ubvur uwurɛ abika adɔsa, abirabɛ aki iyisa &lt;&lt;abirabɛ Unum aka asɛng umbɔ&gt;&gt;. Unga adzuma atsɛng ubvur ha afituwe abika avarhe, abirabɛ aka awe ru uver nu ayetnum ri itsi imangmangmbɔ. Ubitru atsɛng ubvur ha ayituwe umbɔ Isarhe Iyiki Ize ri itsi Uyesu Ukiristo, uwuruwi akpenga, isisoknga nu ibibemuwe iyiki ibibanga iki iwu ubin ifosa ra abika adɔsa. Unga agɔr agɛ aze umbɔ abima ra ayetnummbɔ na awe ru ikeramɛn ugɛ iwu iviviri iwuri idɛyiwe imangmangmbɔ na agɛ umbɔ awuri iyɛimbɔ ugbɛta ri &lt;&lt;ivangyɛ Uyesu Ukiristo aka idzeka.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="ip">Ikɛi uner uku utsɛng ubvur ha afituwe abika adɔsa agɛ asei isei ru nyaka abirabɛ aka awu abi Ukiristo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abinkɛ aka awe umɔ</para>
  <para style="io1">Utsutson ri itsi ubvur ha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyiyituwe ififɔrh iyi Unum <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1.3-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imesa ri itsi ibibɛk iyiki irhika <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1.13—2.10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Itser abika adɔsa ri ivang ayetnum <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2.11—4.19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Irhɛrhi itsi nu itser abika adɔsa <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Imimasha <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5.12-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Ubvur uwurɛ udzeku Ubitru uner itser Uyesu Ukiristo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Umum itsɛnge abirabɛ Unum aka asɛng umbɔ aka awu atsen ru upfung, asita asei ri inang ra abĩ Ufontu, nu Ugarhatiya, nu Ukafadokiya, nu Uasiya, nu Ubitiniya. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Unum Utɛ ri ihwihwɛngnga, unga asɛng umbi ru Ipfunga isare umbi, ngge itsú umbi adɔsu Uyesu Ukiristo, nu isisar ra adzirhnga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Imimuta nu ididɔɔr irhɛirhɛ iwe nggu umbi.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ifosa iyi urhɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Ikpikpoi iwe ru Unum, Utɛ Uteijeemɛn Uyesu Ukiristo! Ru nggaa atorhnga, unga aka amar umɛn iwe abika afa ru ubok isok ra akpe Uyesu Ukiristo, ngge itsú umɛn iwe ru ifosa iki iwe ru urhɛ. <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Nu ukam hã uku usi íkpekpɔ, usi ídakpɔ use usatukpɔ, uwu ukpumbi ra afã. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Ru ubok imangmangmbi Unum akũ ijeenga avina umbi utsɛku umbi ayɛi ififɔrh iyɛrɛ, unga aka iwuri idɛyiwe ngge ri imimasha inum. <verse eid="1PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Ra akɛrɛ ha àka agɔm akarhãrhã, nggayɛ umbi awuri ihwambi ayetnum icɛrɛ ivanga ukunjiir, ri kishoo ikpũ ivivirayɛ umbi aka iwe. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Akɛrɛ ha aba, ngge itsú imangmangmbi iwe ru ugarh inangge uzinarhi ukpuku utsutsĩm. Nggakpi umbɔ aka isaka agbisha ukpɔ ru urha ru nyaka umbɔ aki iviri igbishu uzinarhi, nggayɛ imangmangmbi inangge uzinarhi. Nggee ivang imangmangmbi iki idɛ̃ɛ̃ iker ru iviviri irhɛirhɛ, ngge iwuri ikũwã umbi ukpoi urhɛrhɛ nu imor ri ivangyɛ Uyesu Ukiristo aka idzeka. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Nggayɛ umbi anasi inyãmbi unga, bɔr umbi abemumbi unga. Nggayɛ umbi asi inyãmbi unga icɛrɛ bɔr umbi awembi ri imangmang ru unga, umbi awembi ri itɛnamɛn akarhãrhã, <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>ubinkutsu umbi ayɛimbi ugbɛtɛ imangmangmbi, ififɔrh ipfumbi.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Arherhi ififɔrh iyɛrɛ, abika asɔm Arherhu-Num aka angwɛ̃dzɛn na arhisa na arhusa, ivang umbɔ aka arherhe imimuta ha iki iba ru umbi. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Ipfu Ukiristo iwe ru umbɔ ni idɛyiwe umbɔ ikpũ ayetnumkɛ Ukiristo aka ihwa nu nggaa imoryɛ umbɔ aka idzowe unga. Nggee umbɔ abee ihwɛng Ukiristo awu ungaa, ikɛi ukang akɛrɛ ha aka ikorhe. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Adɛyikumbɔ agɛ umbɔ asi itɔ̃mbɔ itser atsimbɔ bɔr atɔ̃ itser umbi. Icɛrɛ Isarhe Iyiki Ize iyɛrɛ umbɔ aka arherhuwa umbi ra abirabɛ aka adũwã ri ijee Ipfu Isarsatangge umbɔ aka adene ngge idzeka afã. Uko ípfu itser-Num ibeengge inyã ake.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Àka awe asasar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Nggee, àka agbisha amɛnmbi atɔ̃ itser, àka akpɔm atsimbi, àka atsu ifosambi kishoo ru umata umbɔ aka idzaa umbi ru unum Uyesu Ukiristo aka idzeka. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Àka awe ru nyaka awɛkaci abika adɔsa arherhe, àka niba aneke ikpona abin ake anyanguke amɛnmbi ru nyaka umbi aka awe ru ida ihwihwɛng. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Bɔr ru nyaka unga uwuku uyisa umbi awu asasar, àka awe asasar ri itsermbi kishoo. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔrngge ugɛ, &lt;&lt;Àka awe asasar, ubinkutsu umum iwu asasar.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Urha 11.44</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 11:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19.2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:7">20.7</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Umbi aba ayisa ugɛ Utɛ uwu afã uwuku utsu uvau ru ubɛn unera ashia ri itɛngasu, nggee àka asisei iwei iyi atsen nggimi. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Ubinkutsu, umbi ahwɛngmbi ugɛ asi ikũmbɔ abin aka atsutsim ugɛɛ uazurhfa use uzinarhi agoimbɔ umbi ra agbeyi atokambi aki ibɛm, <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>bɔr nggu adzirh aka awe ru ugarh aki Ukiristo, uwuruwi aka awe ru nyaku ungwɛ̃ itsurhi iyi idɛm, iyiriyɛ iki ishingge ru uvau use utauu. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Atirha asɛng unga na adɔrha amunu upfunga, bɔr unga adzeka ri imimasha ivang iyɛrɛ ri itsimbi. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Iwe ru uboknga umbi aka awe ru imangmang ru Unum, uwuku usoyiwe unga ra akpe na akpoi unga, nggee imangmangmbi nu ifosambi iwe ru Unum.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Icɛrɛ ri idɔsu idzidzɛrhe umbi awe asasar ngge itsú umbi abema adɔkambi. Àka adzuma abema adɔkambi ra amɛnmbi. <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Amar umbi imar iyiki ifa ikɛi, asi iwea ri ikpũ imar urhɛ uwuku ukpe, bɔr udzeku ikpũ urhɛ uwu ugbagbaa, ru ubok Arherhu-Num uwu urhɛ ri ibibima. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">&lt;&lt;Kishoo anera awu ru nyaku ubĩĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">nu kishoo ikpikpoimbɔ iwu ru nyaki ifur ubĩĩ idɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">ubĩĩ uku isaku ukoyi nu ifurngge igba,<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>bɔr Arherhu Uteijee adɛ̃ɛ̃ ugbagbaa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Uish 40.6-8</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Arherha ha awu Isarhe Iyiki Izeyɛ umbɔ aka arherhuwa umbi.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Nggee, àka atsũwe atsimbi ru ikpũ amɛn aka abewe, ukpukpeta, unyɛ̃ɛ̃ nu urhena ukpu ubɛn ikpũa. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>Ru nyaka írheng awɛkaci iki ikponi iyam abɛ̃, Àka akponu ihwɛng Arherhu Unum, ake itsu umbi aseng ri ififɔrhmbi, <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/>icɛrɛ umbi aka abanga agũ ugɛ Uteijee awu azeze.<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Utarh urhɛ nu aner umbɔ aka asɛng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Àka aba ru unga, utarh urhɛ ha anera aka akpɛ̃mbɔ, bɔr Unum asɛng ukpɔ uwe ru ugarh ru unga. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Umbi ikɛi, awe ru nyaka atarh, Unum unga awu uner idzin, unga ani ikũ umbi akũ adzin iyanga. Ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo, umbi awe asarkasar abika idzowe idɛm-Num iyiriyɛ iki itsu Unum agũibɛn. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">&lt;&lt;Unyã, umum itsu utarh ru Usihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">utarh ukpuku uwu ru ugarh umbɔ aka asɛng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">ukpu angboki idzin,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">kishoo uwuku uwe ru imangmang ru unga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">asi ígũa atsa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Uish 28.16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Nggee ru umbi abi imangmang, utarh ukpirɛ uwu ru ugarh. Bɔr ra abika asheri imangmang,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">&lt;&lt;Utarhkpi abi idzin aka akpɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ukpɔ uwu utarh angboki idzin.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Amb 118.22</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>Nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">&lt;&lt;Utarhkpi uku utsu anera akwɛr itok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">nu ifa iki itsu umbɔ agbaigba.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:14">Uish 8.14</ref></char>.</note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Unum atsu umbɔ akwɛr itok, ubinkutsu, asi idɔsumbɔ isarhe iyiki ize.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Bɔr umbi awu abirabɛ umbɔ aka asɛng, abika adzowe idɛm-Num ri iya uyɛrhe, asarkasar abĩ, anerabɛ aka awe abi Unum, agɛ umbi ama akũ ikpikpoinga adzeka unga aka ayisa umbi ru uzĩ adzek atsĩ ri idzeu irhirhangnga. <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Isha umbi asi iwembi aner Unum, bɔr icɛrɛ umbi awe aner Unum. Isha umbi asi iyɛimbi atorh, bɔr icɛrɛ umbi ayɛimbi atorh.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Àka adɔsa arherha abi ijee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>A aze awɛrhamum, umum ifituwa umbi, ru nyaka atsen ru upfung, àka neke idɔsa abin ikponi iyor, aki itang iwa ri ipfumbi. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Àka asei nggu amɛn aka arhurhika ra ateu anera aka asi ihwɛngmbɔ Unum, nggayɛ umbɔ ani irhena umbi, umbɔ ama anyã irhirhikambi na akpoi Unum ru unumkpi unga aka iba ayepa umɛn.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Àka adɔsa arherhe ubɛn abi ijee ri itsi Uteijee, ra ayɛrhe use ubɛn ijee ra anernga kishoo, <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>use agomna, unga aka adene umbɔ atsu ufai ra abi uvau, na akpoi abika arhika. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Ubinkutsu, awu ubinkpi Unum aka abee nukpɔ, umbi akorhe iyiki ize ngge itsú aguge aneke irherha arherhe ida ihwihwɛngmbɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Àka asei isei ru nyaka abika afɔn, bɔr àka niba anyangu ififɔn atsirmbi iyiki ibewe, bɔr àka asei ru nyaka agãrhã Unum. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Àka adzowe undzumu imor ru ubɛn unera, àka abemu ukpui abika adɔsa, àka agũ iwei Unum na adzowe imor ru uyɛrhe.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Umbi agãrhã, àka adɔsa arherhe ateiyambi ri idzowe undzumu imor, niba iwengge ra ateiya abi amɛn aka aze nu ididɔɔr ukpekũ, bɔr ikɛi nggu abi amɛn aka atsoo. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Unera aba abimunga ri igũ ighong ayetnum aka ada irhika, na ahwɛnga Unum, awu ubin ukpoi. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Bɔr umbɔ aba akwɛr umbi ra avaumbi, ibibimambi iwu use? Bɔr umbi aba ahwa ayetnum ri ikorhu iyiki ize na abima, awu ibibemu Unum niyɔ. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Ubinkutsu ayisa umbi ri ikpũ akɛrɛ ha, Ukiristo ahwa ayetnum ri itsimbi na aneka umbi utsĩndĩwi umbi aka idɔsa adaknga.<verse eid="1PE 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>&lt;&lt;Unga asi ikorhunga arhim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:22">na asi irherhunga igbɛrangwĩ ra angwĩnga.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Uish 53.9</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Ivangyɛ umbɔ aka arhena unga, unga asi irhena afasa, ivangyɛ unga aka ahwa ayetnum, asi ifasa. Bɔr unga atsu amɛnnga ru uwuku uvarhe arherhe idzidzɛrhe. <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Unga nibikanga atsã arhimmɛn ri iyornga ni igãrhãmau ucucii, ngge ima itsu amɛnmɛn aki arhim akpe nu umɛn ĩbɛk ri irhirhika, ru ubok isɔɔnga umbi akpo ikikerhe. <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Umbi aka agwirmbi ru nyaku ídɔi, bɔr icɛrɛ umbi aka abambi ru uner ughãwã nu uwuku udzɛu ipfumbi.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Akatsɛrh nu akatsak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Ru nyaka ha, umbi akatsɛrh àka adɔsa arherhe atsakmbi ngge itsú ubɛn ukutsak ru umbɔ aba akpɛ̃ɛ̃ Isarhe Iyiki Ize, umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ adarhmbi umbɔ, asi íwea irhɛm bɔr ri ikpũ isiseimbi, <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>ivangyɛ umbɔ aka inya itɛn amɛnmbi nggu idzowe imor ri ibibɛkmbi. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Niba atsumbi amɛnmbi ri igbɛr idzam iyi iyor awia, ru nyaka umbɔ itsɛrhi itsi, nu itsu abin uzinarhi, nu itsim atorho aka aze. <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Nu ngge iki iwe rimi, àka aneke idzammbi iwe amɛn aka aze, idzam iyiriyɛ iki isi ísatungge iyiki ikpɔm atsi, iyiriyɛ iki iwu ru undzumu ugarh ru Unum. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Ubinkutsu akɛrɛ ha aweke ishaa ri ivang asarkasar akatsɛrh abika atsu ifosambɔ ru Unum aki igbɛr idzam awu azeze. Umbɔ aki isaka adɔsa arherhe atsakmbɔ, <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>ru nyaku Usaratu aka adɔsa arherhe utsaknga Uibrahim, na ayisa unga uteiyanga. Umbi awu anapu Usaratu, umbi aba akorha arhikumbi na asi igũmbi iwei.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Umbi akatsak, rimi hã àka adzowe imor ra atsɛ̃mbi na anyanga ra amɛnmbi ugɛ umbɔ asi ikermbɔ ru nyaka umbi na ahwɛng ugɛ umbi awu abika ayɛi ukam umata Unum urhɔnga, nggee utsur ubin ukpɔɔ ukɛnkpɔ ifɛn-Nummbi.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayetnum ri ikorhe iyiki ize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Ri imimasha, neke kishoo amɛnmbi awu unying, àka agũ atorh adɔka, àka abema adɔka ru nyaka angwɛ̃yi, àka ayike adɔka nggu irhɛrhi itsi. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Niba afaimbi iyiki ibewe nggu iki ibewe, use urhena nggu urhena, bɔr àka afai nggu itsuke idorh, ubinkutsu awu akɛrɛ ha atsu Unum ayisa umbi, ngge itsú umbi awe abika akpo ukam igũibɛn. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">&lt;&lt;Ubɛn unera aka abemi ibibɛk</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">na anyã inum iyiki ize</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">awu ufang unga aneke irherhi iyiki ibewe ra angwĩnga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">na aneke irhɛm iyi igbɛrangwĩ.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Awu ufang unga aneke ikorhe iyiki ibewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">na akorhi iyiki ize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">awu ufang unga abee ididɔɔr na adɔsa ngge.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Ubinkutsu asu Uteijee arhi abika arhika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">na akpe atonga ri ifɛn-Nummbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">bɔr asu Uteijee awe ri igamtsak nggu abika akorhe iki ibewe.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Amb 34.12-16</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Bɔr umbi aba atsu amɛnmbi abee ikorhe iyiki irhika, ungaa awuri ikorhuwa umbi iyiki ibewe? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Bɔr uko umbi aba ahwa ayetnum ri ikorhe abin aka arhika, umbi awu abi idorh. Nggee àka niba agũmbi ighong use agũmbi iwei umbɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">Uish 8.12</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Bɔr ra amɛnmbi àka atsu Ukiristo awe Uteijee. Ubɛn ivang àka adzɛu idɛyiwe ubɛn unera aka irhusa ri itsi ifosayɛ umbi aka awerangge, bɔr àka akorhe nggu ididɔɔr nu idzowe imor. <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>Àka angwɛ̃ itɛnamɛn. Ngge ítsu abika arhena umbi ri ikorhi iyiki izembi ru Ukiristo agũ atsak ru urhenambɔ. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Aba awu ibibee Unum, azea umbi ahwa ayetnum ri ikorhe iyiki ize nu umbi aka ihwa ayetnum ri ikorhe iyiki ibewe. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Ukiristo akpe idikunga unying ri itsi arhimmɛn kishoo, uwuku urhurhika akpe ra abirabɛ aka asi irhikumbɔ, ngge itsú unga akũna umbi aba ru Unum. Atsu iyornga ra akpe nu Unum atsu urhɛnga uwe ru Ipfunga. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Ru ubokngge unga aka azĩ adzowe isarhe ru ípfuyɛ iki iwe ru ugborzĩ, <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>umbɔ aka akpɛ̃mbɔ idɔsu Unum ishaisha ivang Unum aka adɔng amɛnnga adzɛu ri inum Unuhu ivangyɛ unga aka adɛ̃ɛ̃ igbishu ukhukhɔɔ. Ri ivang hã inera utɔrɔk ukpekũ ru kishoo, aka abɛk ra amɛ̃. <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Amɛ̃ hã awu utsar isorhu ubɔtisima uwuku ufɔrh umbi icɛrɛ, asi iwea isorhi iyor bɔr awu ibibemuwe iyi amɛn aka aze ra asu Unum. Ngge ifɔrha umbi ri isok ra akpe Uyesu Ukiristo, <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>uwuruwi aka azĩã ra afã na awu ru ubok ugha Unum, nu ípfu itser-Num nu ípfu iyi iyɛrhe nu iyi ijee kishoo iwu iyinga.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Isisei abika adɔsu Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Ru nyaku Ukiristo aka ahwa ayetnum ri iyor, nggee àka abema ihwa ayetnum aki ikpũ hã, ubinkutsu ubɛn uwuku uhwa ayetnum ri iyor aka agau itsinga nukpɔ nggu arhim. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Ubinkutsu, ibibɛknga ru upfung isi iwengge iyiki ibewe iyi ikponi iyor ri inum iyiki ibɔr, bɔr iwu iyi ibibemu Unum. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Ubinkutsu umbi aka aghawukumbi ivangmbi ri iyi isha ri ikorha abinkɛ abika asheri ihwɛng Unum aka isaka ikorhe, awu ikorhe iyiki itãrhã, ikpona iyi iyor, nu afĩrhã, nu ikikɔng ihwa abin, nu idzowe itsi ra abin ishĩ. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Icɛrɛ abika ashe ihwɛng Unum ani idzeu idzeu umbi aka asi igbopumbi atsi nggu umbɔ ri ikorha abin aka abewe ha ru nyaki isha, umbɔ arhena umbi. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Bɔr umbɔ awuri ivarhukumbɔ abinkɛ umbɔ aka akorhe ru unga aka itsu uvau ra abi urhɛ nu abika akpe. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Ubin hã ukpi uku utsu umbɔ adzowe Isarhe Iyiki Ize ra abika akpe, ngge itsú umbɔ atsu uvau ru umbɔ ri iyor ru nyaka anera, bɔr adɛ̃ɛ̃ abɛkmbɔ ru Unum ru nyaki ipfu.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Imimasha abina kishoo iki iyongge. Nggee àka angwɛ̃dzɛn na akpɔm atsimbi ngge itsú umbi adɛ̃ɛ̃ afɛn-Num. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Ubinkpi uku unang kishoo, àka atoma abema adɔka ra amɛnmbi kishoo, ubinkutsu ibibema iki isaki ifɔme arhim arhɛrhɛ. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Àka ayɛi adɔka ra ayambi nggu ida ibvibvun. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Ubɛn unera akũ izũwãyɛ unga aka ayɛi akũ ayike abɔɔ, ri idzidzɛrhe akũ atɔ̃ itser ra atsĩndĩ imimutu Unum. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Unera aba adzowuka isarhe, unga akorha ngge ugɛ unerwi Unum aki irherha arherhe ra angwĩnga. Unera aba atɔ̃ɔ̃ itser, unga atɔ̃ ngge nggu ikeryɛ Unum aka adzowe unga. Ngge itsú abina kishoo awe aki ikpikpoi ru Unum ru ubok Uyesu Ukiristo. Ru unga ikpikpoi iwe nu ijee ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa. Iwerimi.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayetnum ri idɔsu Ukiristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Umbi aze awɛrhamum, àka niba adzeumbi idzeu ra ayetnum akarhãrhã aki ivira umbi, ugɛɛ abin aka afa akpo umbi. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Bɔr àka agɔm ugɛ umbi ahwambi ayetnum ru nyaka Ukiristo, ngge itsú umbi awu ra anggɔm arhɛrhɛ ri ivangyɛ unga aka ikũ ikpikpoinga adzeka. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Umbɔ aba arhena umbi ri itsi Ukiristo, umbi awu abi idorh, ubinkutsu Ipfu-Num iyi ikpikpoi isei nggu umbi. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Umbi aba ahwambi ayetnum, niba aweke aki ifɛr uner use ivɛu use iyiki ibewe iyɔɔ use uwuku ushɔng urherhe. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Bɔr umbi aba ahwa ayetnum akika awe abi Ukiristo, àka niba agũmbi atsa, àka akpoi Unum, ugɛ ayisa umbi nggu itsok ha.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Ubinkutsu ivanga iki iwengge umbɔ aka itirhi ivarha arherhe abi iya Unum. Umbɔ aba atirhi nggu umɛn, iwuri iwu uguse nggu abirabɛ aka akpɛ̃mbɔ igũ Isarhe Iyiki Izeyɛ iki idzeku Unum? <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Nu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">&lt;&lt;Ngge iba ighongge uner uwuku urhurhika aka ifɔrh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">iwuri iwu uguse ra abirabɛ aka asi igũmbɔ iwei Unum nu abi arhim?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Uny 11.31</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Nggee umbi aba ahwa ayetnum ri ibibemu Unum, àka atsu atsimbi ru Unum uwuku umuna umbi na akorhu iyiki ize ubɛn unuma.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Izĩ ra anggbaashi nu awɛdzɛm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Izĩ ra anggbaashi ru umbi, umum ishɔ̃rhã ru nyaku unggbaashi ikɛi uwu ideka ayetnum Ukiristo nu uwuruwi aka ikpo ugau ri ikpikpoiyɛ iki idzeka. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Àka adzɛu ukpui idɔi ukpu Unum umbɔ aka adzaa umbi ididen, àka atɔ̃ itser ru nyaka abi ughãwã, niba iwengge ri inggang, bɔr awu ubinkpi umbi aka abee ikikorhe, ashia iyi ikponu uhwɛk, bɔr aka abee itɔ̃ itser. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Niba awembi abi ijee ra anera Unum aka adzaa umbi, bɔr àka awe abinkɛ umbɔ aka imesa ru ukpui ha. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Ivangyɛ Unggbaashi abi Ughãwã hã aka idzeka, umbi awuri iyɛimbi ifur ikpikpoi iki isi ísatungge.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Umbi awɛdzɛm, rimi hã àka adɔsa arherhe anggbaashi. Àka arhɛrhe atsimbi ra adɔka, ubinkutsu, itsɛng Arherhu-Num igɔr igɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">&lt;&lt;Unum awe ri igamtsak nggu abika aberi itsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">bɔr unga aka isaka amutuwe abika arhɛrhi itsi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Àka anyã ikɛi: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Uny 3.34</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1PE 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Nggee, àka arhɛrhuwe atsimbi ru Unum uner ijee, ngge itsú unga aberuwa umbi ri ivangyɛ unga aka abee. <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Àka atsuke kishoo abinkɛ aka aghong umbi ru unga, ubinkutsu unga awu uner uwuku ukpɔm umbi.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Àka akpɔm atsimbi na adzɛu. Unggamtsakmbi Undenggũ ani ayarhe ighau ru nyaku utɛ̃rhĩmi, abee uwuruwi unga aka itãiwe. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Niba abɔrkumbi ugarh ru unga, àka idɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ri imangmangmbi, ubinkutsu umbi ahwɛngmbi angwɛ̃mbi abika adɔsa ru upfunga adɛ̃ɛ̃ izɛ̃rhã ri ikpũ ayetnum hã.<figure style="fig" alt="A lion" file="hk00046b.tif" size="col" loc="5.9" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="5.8">Utɛ̃rhĩmi</figure><verse eid="1PE 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Nu Unum uwu umata kishoo, aka ayisa umbi atsĩ ri ikpikpoinga iyi ugbagbaa ru ubok Ukiristo, umbi aka imaa ayetnum ukunjiir, unga awuri ishɔɔrka umbi na afituwa umbi, adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Ijee iwu iyinga ugbagbaa nu ugbagbaa. Iwerimi.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Imimasha ighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Nggu iyiyike Usirha, uwuruwi umum iki inyanga unga awu ungwɛ̃mɛn uwu idzidzɛrhe, umum itsɛnga umbi ubvur uwirɛ uku utsɛɛu, ifituwa umbi ni idekuwa umbi ugɛ iyɛrɛ iwu idzidzɛrhe imimutu Unum. Àka adɛ̃ɛ̃ aker ru ngge. <verse eid="1PE 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Ukpui abika adɔsa ri nggimi ru Ubabirha nu ungwɛ̃mum Umarku, umbɔ aka asɛng ru nyaka umbi, aghwe umbi. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Àka aghwe adɔka nggu ibibema iyi abika adudɔsa. Ididɔɔr iwe nggu umbi kishoo umbi abika awu ru Ukiristo.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
